 remiere)</em>*<br />  Shavon Lloyd: <em>So Breaks the Sun (2017)</em><br 
 /><br />  *<em>First-Prize Winner of the 2027<br />  NOTUS Student Compos
 ition Contest<br /></em><br /><strong>About the Artists</strong><br /><br
  />  Recognized with The American Prizes in both Choral Composition (2014
