 arned an M.A. and a Ph.D. in Composition from the Eastman School of Music
 \, in 2003 and 2005\, respectively. His teachers there included Sydney Ho
 dkinson\, Christopher Rouse\, Steven Stucky\, and Augusta Read Thomas. Tr
 avers has received numerous awards\, including an Arts and Letters Award\
 , Goddard Lieberson Fellowship\, and Charles Ives Scholarship\, all from 
 the American Academy of Arts and Letters. He also won the 2021 Mader Comp
 osition Competition for solo organ\, 2016 Red Note Music Festival Composi
