DESCRIPTION:With the cold weather approaching\, the November First Thursd
 ays will bring its celebration of art\, ideas\, and community inside. The
  event will take place at several indoor spaces across campus\, including
  IU Auditorium (https://www.iuauditorium.com/)\, Eskenazi Museum of Art (
 https://artmuseum.indiana.edu/)\, Grunwald Gallery (https://eskenazi.indi
 ana.edu/exhibitions/grunwald-gallery/index.html)\, Lilly Library (https:/
 /libraries.indiana.edu/lilly-library)\, Wells Library (https://libraries.
 indiana.edu/herman-b-wells-library)\, Wylie House Museum (https://librari
 es.indiana.edu/wylie-house-museum)\, McCalla (https://collections.iu.edu/
 mccalla/visit.html)\, and Ford-Crawford Hall (https://music.indiana.edu/n
 ews-events/directions-parking/index.html). Each space will host its own l
 ineup of activities and offer special giveaways. IU Students can also use
  a special campus shuttle to get around to all participating venues! For 
 the full list of locations\, activities\, and giveaway details\, please v
 isit go.iu.edu/first-thursdays (https://artsandhumanities.indiana.edu/cou
 ncil-programs/first-thursdays/index.html).
