 Bach: <em>Four Preludes and Fugues from "The Well-Tempered Clavier\, Book
  2" (BWVv</em><em>890-93)</em><br />  Freund: <em>Preludes (including the
  premiere of "Prelude 2026…Luminous Shadows…")</em><br /><br /><stron
 g>About the Artist</strong><br /><br /><strong>Don Freund</strong> is pro
 fessor of music in composition at the Indiana University Jacobs School of
  Music\, where he has been on faculty since 1992. His students from a 50-
 year teaching career continue to win an impressive array of awards and re
