SUMMARY:OECD Workshop: Applying for Faculty Teaching Positions
DESCRIPTION:Students\, sign up here &gt\;  Join us for a panel discussion
  where you'll get to hear from Jacobs faculty who recently went through a
  job search and/or who regularly serve on search committees: Norman Krieg
 er (Chair\, Piano Department)\, Matt Hightower (Associate Professor of Tu
 ba and Euphonium)\, Jason Bergman (Professor of Trumpet)\, and Raymond Sa
 ge (Head of Musical Theatre Voice and Musical Theatre Voice Pedagogy).
